<title>USA: RDO Equipment to acquire equipment dealer.</title>
<headline>RDO Equipment to acquire equipment dealer.</headline>
<dateline>FARGO, N.D. 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>RDO Equipment Co said Thursday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire the operating assets of Kuenstler Machinery LP, which distributes, sells, rents and services construction equipment primarily supplied by Deere &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed. The dealership had 1996 revenues of about $20 million, RDO said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to be completed by mid-June, RDO, an equipment dealer, said.</p>
<p>RDO shares rose 5/8 to 17-5/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
